  "description": "Tae-U and Yun-Sol have always been an unlikely pair. As childhood best friends, both are too afraid of losing the other to admit their feelings. But when Yun-Sol's soul becomes a part of her doll after a messy accident, things get even more complicated. Will the two be able to find a way for Yun-Sol to become human again... and find love on the way?\n\n(Source: Manta, edited)\n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
